                "content": "\nloadTask, err := cli.RefreshLoad(ctx, milvusclient.NewRefreshLoadOption(collectionName))\nif err != nil {\n    // handle err\n}\nerr = loadTask.Await(ctx)\nif err != nil {\n    // handler err\n",
